<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-10-01 | Day 161: AI Transforms from Tool to Agent" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="Meta launches AI travel agent Muse; GPU cloud GMI secures $668M from Nvidia; film industry shifts from managing people to managing Agents; Huawei advises car companies to focus on division of labor. AI transforms from tool to Agent." navActive="diary" lang="en">
